                                              'stage5_join_output.json.\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Save:** scratch/day16_lab/stage5_join_output.json',
                                              '**Stage 6: Execute SQL Aggregations and GROUP BY Analytics**\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Location:** local terminal\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Actions:**\n'
                                              'Compute total revenue, order count, and average order value per '
                                              'customer using GROUP BY and aggregate functions.\n'
                                              '```bash\n'
                                              "cat <<'EOF' > scratch/day16_lab/run_aggregations.py\n"
                                              'import sqlite3\n'
                                              'import json\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              'conn = sqlite3.connect("scratch/day16_lab/bakery.db")\n'
                                              'cursor = conn.cursor()\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              "query = '''\n"
                                              'SELECT \n'
                                              '    c.customer_id,\n'
                                              '    c.name AS customer_name,\n'
                                              '    COUNT(o.order_id) AS total_orders,\n'
                                              '    SUM(o.total_cents) AS total_spend_cents,\n'
                                              '    ROUND(AVG(o.total_cents), 2) AS avg_spend_cents\n'
                                              'FROM customers c\n'
                                              'LEFT JOIN orders o ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n'
                                              'GROUP BY c.customer_id, c.name\n'
                                              'ORDER BY total_spend_cents DESC;\n'
                                              "'''\n"
                                              'cursor.execute(query)\n'
                                              'rows = cursor.fetchall()\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              'aggregations = [\n'
                                              '    {\n'
                                              '        "customer_id": r[0],\n'
                                              '        "customer_name": r[1],\n'
                                              '        "total_orders": r[2],\n'
                                              '        "total_spend_cents": r[3],\n'
                                              '        "avg_spend_cents": r[4]\n'
                                              '    }\n'
                                              '    for r in rows\n'
                                              ']\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              'with open("scratch/day16_lab/stage6_aggregations.json", "w") as f:\n'
                                              '    json.dump(aggregations, f, indent=2)\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              'print(f"Executed GROUP BY aggregation query: {len(aggregations)} '
                                              'customer summaries generated.")\n'
                                              'conn.close()\n'
                                              'EOF\n'
                                              'python3 scratch/day16_lab/run_aggregations.py\n'
                                              'cat scratch/day16_lab/stage6_aggregations.json\n'
                                              '```\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Expected result:**\n'
                                              'Aggregation metrics computed per customer and saved to '
                                              'stage6_aggregations.json.\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Save:** scratch/day16_lab/stage6_aggregations.json',
                                              '**Stage 7: Execute Line-Item Deep Aggregation with HAVING Filter**\n'
                                              '\n'
                                              '**Location:** local terminal\n'
                                              '\n'
