             'y="165"></rect>\n'
             '<text fill="#34d399" font-size="10" font-weight="700" x="505" y="185">Zero Overselling: Invariant '
             'Strictly Preserved</text>\n'
             '<text fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="9" x="505" y="202">• Physical inventory never drops below 0</text>\n'
